\alpha_i\Big) - a.$$ Let $S_A = \bigcup \text{(non-trivial } A\text{-paths)}$,
so $|S_A| = k + a$. The number of isolated $A$-stations is $$n^2 - |S_A| = n^2 -k - a = n^2 - (n^2 - n + 1) - a = (n - 1) - a \ge 0,$$ so $\boxed{a \le n - 1}$.Similarly $\boxed{b \le n - 1}$.

